 as tolerated. Educate on recognizing signs of worsening symptoms (e.g., increased swelling, locking, instability) which would require urgent evaluation.', 'follow_up': 'Reassessment in 1-2 weeks or sooner if symptoms worsen. If MRI confirms a significant ligamentous or meniscal injury, referral to orthopedic surgery for further management may be required.'}}"
